      "id": "e03",
      "type": "reading",
      "title": "Long time no see",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "আরে, নাদিয়া! অনেক দিন পরে দেখা হল!",
          "tr": "are, nadiya! onek din pore dekha holo!",
          "en": "Hey, Nadia! It's been ages!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "হ্যাঁ! তুমি নাকি এখন ঢাকায় থাকো?",
          "tr": "hya~! tumi naki ekhon dhakay thako?",
          "en": "Yes! I hear you live in Dhaka now?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "হ্যাঁ, কিন্তু ঢাকায় খুব জ্যাম, তাই না?",
          "tr": "hya~, kintu dhakay khub jyam, tai na?",
          "en": "Yes, but there's so much traffic in Dhaka, isn't there?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "জ্যাম তো সবসময় থাকে।",
          "tr": "jyam to shobshomoy thake.",
          "en": "Well, there's always traffic."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "আর বাসে কত ভিড়!",
          "tr": "ar base koto bhir!",
          "en": "And how crowded the buses are!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "তুমি কাল আমাদের বাসায় আসবে, না?",
          "tr": "tumi kal amader bashay ashbe, na?",
          "en": "You'll come to our place tomorrow, won't you?"
        }
      ],
      "question": "What has Nadia heard about Rafi?",
      "options": [
        "He lives in Dhaka now",
        "He is moving abroad",
        "He has a new car"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "why": "**নাকি** in a statement: 'I hear, apparently'."
    },
